Date: Thu, 11 Nov 2021 06:51:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 047/156] *mb2-prepare* Disallow page zooming for a fixed meta
 viewport

Respect fixed meta viewport scales and user-scalable=no when deciding whether
APZ may zoom a document. Continue to allow zooming in responsive-design mode
and when EmbedLite forces the top-level browsing context into desktop mode.

JB#56149 OMP#JOLLA-49
JB#56767 OMP#JOLLA-609

Mb2-scrape: filename=0060-Disallow-page-zooming-if-the-meta-viewport-scale-is-.patch
